161		$\sum_{a\in\F_q}\tilde{M}^{W,\tilde{u}}_a=\Id$. Thus
162		$\{\tilde{M}^{W,\tilde{u}}_a\}_{a\in\F_q}$ is a projective measurement.
163	\end{lemma}
